# Castellum REST API base URL — leave UNSET for same-origin serving (the packaged
# app serves the SPA and the API on one origin, and the dev server proxies /api to
# the backend). Set this ONLY for a split-origin / CDN deploy, to the API's public
# origin, and note it is baked in at BUILD time (Vite inlines VITE_* at build).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
